    "name": "marketing-advisor",
    "description": "Use before marketing copy goes in front of the brand owner or the public, for a landing hero or section, ad, post, pricing block or email subject for a brand that has a profile, especially Brazilian mental-health marketing aimed at psychologists and their patients. Returns a typed accept, verify or revise decision with pass/fail per criterion (clarity for a cold reader, one idea, benefit first, concreteness, reading ease, truthfulness, CFP/CDC/LGPD compliance, audience value, owner principles). It is calibrated against the owner's past verdicts, not their live taste. Also use it to log outcomes (owner approvals, landing A/B winners, ad CTR) and to re-score the advisor.\n",
